stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CaptureDeliveryReceived
    CaptureDeliveryReceived --> SignatureCheck

    state SignatureCheck <<choice>>
    SignatureCheck --> Rejected: signature invalid
    SignatureCheck --> KnownPayment: signature valid

    note right of KnownPayment
        Every correctly signed capture
        webhook belongs to a known payment.
    end note

    KnownPayment --> LedgerEntryCreated: create a new ledger entry
    LedgerEntryCreated --> ReceiptCaptured: update receipt status
    ReceiptCaptured --> Reconciled

    note right of LedgerEntryCreated
        Each valid delivery takes this path,
        including another delivery of the
        same capture.
    end note

    Rejected --> [*]
    Reconciled --> [*]

